            "review_title": "Review at The Blackbird Bar",
            "review_text": "Linh G\n1 contribution\n0\nEscape the noise of crowded city.\nJun 2022 • Couples\nGood place to go with company, friend if you need a quite one for little talkings. If you come alone, don’t worry, the bartenders were so nice and friendly. You won’t feel being left alone when you come there.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 1, 2022",
