            "review_title": "Review at The Blackbird Bar",
            "review_text": "Shubham Garg\n2 contributions\n0\nPeace in the heart of Saigon\nJun 2022 • Friends\nIn the loud busy streets of saigon. This bar was a perfect relaxing place where I could enjoy a few drinks in peace.\nThe lighting is perfect for a nice relaxing mood. It has great music which is not too lound so you have noce conversations with you company.\nThe drinks were amazing. I specially liked the \"Revolution\" which is one of their signature drinks.\nEven the food menu were extreemly delicius specially the sauces they offered with the chicken Wings.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 7, 2022",
